      "name": "Shadow’s Embrace",
      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "The Fang can climb and walk on vertical surfaces. Mark a Stress to move from one shadow to another within Far range."
    },
    {
      "name": "Pick Off the Straggler",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "Mark a Stress to cause a target within Melee range to make an Instinct Reaction Roll. On a failure, the target must mark 2 Stress and is teleported with the Fang to a shadow within Far range, making them temporarily Vulnerable. On a success, the target must mark a Stress."
    }
